{
  "messages": [
    {
      "key": "gift_given",
      "text": "Here, {gift_item}. The right tool in the right hand saves a lot of trouble.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_given",
      "text": "Take {gift_item}. Keep it useful and it will repay you twice.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.liked",
      "text": "Good. {gift_item} did the job for {tested_villager}.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.liked",
      "text": "Then the advice had a good edge. {tested_villager} liked {gift_item}.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "Wrong tool for the work. For {gift_subject}, use {alternative_gift} instead.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "{gift_item} slipped in the hand? Try {alternative_gift}; cleaner work.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "Wrong tool, wrong job. Pick up {alternative_gift} next time.",
      "dispositions": [
        "cautious",
        "rude",
        "hostile",
        "fearful"
      ],
      "weight": 20
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "You used the advice as-is? Hm. Sharpen your judgment and bring {alternative_gift}.",
      "dispositions": [
        "rude",
        "hostile"
      ],
      "weight": 20
    }
  ],
  "openings": [
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_opening",
      "text": "Mind the smithing table. What do you need?"
    }
  ],
  "closings": [
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_closing",
      "text": "Back to making tools that do not fail, then."
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_chat_handles",
      "type": "chat",
      "text": "Cracked handles are small warnings with expensive timing.",
      "weight": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_question_edges",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "A dull edge makes every simple job into a bad plan.",
      "weight": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_story_tool",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "A good tool is quiet proof that someone cared before trouble started.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_new_greeting_table",
      "type": "greeting",
      "text": "Mind the table. Good tools begin with nobody bumping my elbow.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_new_chat_handle",
      "type": "chat",
      "text": "A handle should fit the hand, not argue with it.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_new_question_edge",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "A sharp edge is useful. A careless one is just trouble with shine.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_new_story_pick",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "I once fixed a pick that had seen more stone than sense.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_new_joke_point",
      "type": "joke",
      "text": "Tool jokes work better when they have a point. Mine sometimes have two.",
      "weight": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_new_insult_bent",
      "type": "insult",
      "text": "That idea is bent past repair.",
      "weight": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_new_chat_workbench",
      "type": "chat",
      "text": "The bench hears every complaint before the finished tool gets praised.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_new_question_crack",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "Cracked handles are warnings. Ignore them and they become stories.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_new_story_shovel",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "A shovel broke on me once because I asked it to do axe work.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_new_hostile_tool",
      "type": "insult",
      "text": "You are using your manners like the wrong tool for the job.",
      "dispositions": [
        "rude",
        "hostile"
      ],
      "weight": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_cured_recognition_warm_1",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "I remember my mind working again, like a tool freed from rust.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "friendly",
        "respectful"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_cured_recognition_warm_2",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "You put a handle back on my life when I could not grip it myself.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "friendly",
        "respectful"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_cured_recognition_confused_1",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "Your face fits the memory, though the memory is still badly forged.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "neutral",
        "cautious"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_cured_recognition_confused_2",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "I remember a cure biting harder than a dull saw, then sense returning.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "neutral",
        "cautious"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_cured_recognition_uneasy_1",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "I remember you. The old fear still catches like a nicked blade.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "rude",
        "hostile",
        "fearful"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_thunderstorm_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The tools and repairs took the thunder badly, but everyone near my station is breathing.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_thunderstorm_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "I checked the tools and repairs first, then the people. Both needed steady hands.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_thunderstorm_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "That storm rattled the tools and repairs; it rattled us more.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_thunderstorm_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Lightning makes every trade feel small. We are safe enough for now.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_thunderstorm_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "I will trust the sky again when it stops threatening the roof.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_fire_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "I checked the tools and repairs for sparks. Then I checked faces for fear.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_fire_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "Smoke gets into everything: lungs, clothes, and the way people talk afterward.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_fire_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "The tools and repairs can be replaced. People cannot. That is the count that matters.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_fire_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "We saved what hands could reach before the flames decided otherwise.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_fire_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "Fire teaches quick priorities. Water, exits, children, neighbors.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_raid_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "During a raid, the tools and repairs matters less than who makes it behind a door.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_raid_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "The horns stopped, but my hands still expect more trouble.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_raid_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "We counted survivors before supplies. That is the right order.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_raid_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "Raiders came looking for weakness. They found a village that remembers how to stand.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_raid_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "I saw fear move through the village and courage move faster.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_night_attack_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "Night trouble always finds the loose latch first. We are fixing those now.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_night_attack_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "I kept near the tools and repairs and listened for anyone calling for help.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_night_attack_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "Dawn did not erase the attack, but it gave us light to count by.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_night_attack_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "The dark tested everyone. Most of us passed by staying alive.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_night_attack_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "We are safe enough, though every shadow is getting inspected twice.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_sandstorm_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The tools and repairs collected half the desert, but the people made it indoors.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_sandstorm_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "I checked the tools and repairs, then checked who was coughing from the dust.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_sandstorm_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Sand in the hinges, sand in the eyes, but no one missing so far.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_sandstorm_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Harsh wind teaches you which doors really close.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_sandstorm_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "We are safe enough, though the village sounds like it is grinding its teeth.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_snowstorm_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The tools and repairs can wait. Warm hands and clear paths matter first.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_snowstorm_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Snow piled against the doors, but everyone near me found shelter.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_snowstorm_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Cold works quietly. We are checking on anyone who went quiet too long.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_snowstorm_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The tools and repairs froze stiff, but the village kept moving.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_village_event_snowstorm_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "We are alright for now. Keep the fires fed and the paths open.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_share_story_1",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "{target_article}? Then bring the right tool if you ever return, and the sense to leave it unused.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_share_story_2",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "A place like {target} can break more than picks. I will warn the workers.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_share_story_3",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "Good tools start with knowing the job. Good survival starts with knowing {target_article} is no ordinary job.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_share_story_4",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "I can sharpen steel, not judgment. Your story about {target} may sharpen both.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_share_story_5",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "If someone insists on going near {target_article}, they had better carry a backup for everything.",
      "weight": 24
    }
  ],
  "pacify": [
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_pacify_success",
      "outcomes": [
        "success"
      ],
      "text": "Fine. I will put the edge away, for now.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_pacify_short",
      "outcomes": [
        "not_enough_emeralds"
      ],
      "text": "Wrong measure. It takes {emerald_cost} {emeralds} to set this right.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "toolsmith_pacify_blocked",
      "outcomes": [
        "blocked_by_reputation"
      ],
      "text": "No. You are using emeralds like the wrong tool.",
      "weight": 26
    }
  ]
}
